 .../BionicProgramLauncherComponent.java       | 58 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/src/main/java/com/winlator/xenvironment/components/BionicProgramLauncherComponent.java

